{%- comment -%}
  The "swag" wordmark from the green brand card. Drawn with a CSS mask (see --wordmark in base.css)
  and filled with the olive gradient on dark, or black on lime.

  Accepts:
  - class {String}: extra classes
  - animate {Boolean}: wipe the wordmark on, left to right, when it scrolls into view (respects reduced motion)
  - label {String}: accessible name, defaults to the shop name
{%- endcomment -%}
<span
  class="wordmark{% if animate %} wordmark--animate{% endif %}{% if class != blank %} {{ class }}{% endif %}"
  role="img"
  aria-label="{{ label | default: shop.name | escape }}"
></span>
